{
 "elemod": 2,
 "id": "smpl-edit",
 "version": "0.7",
 "title": "Sample Edit",
 "description": "SMPL START / SMPL LENGTH show the sample's waveform while you turn them, with a zoom ([PAGE], or turn LEVEL/DATA); push LEVEL/DATA to keep the popup open (push again to let it close); the knob's steps get finer as you zoom in, down to 1/256 of a value. Track Setup ([FUNC] + [TRACK]) > Zero: notes start and end on zero crossings (kept with the sound)",
